## G8 FINDING (in-card fix, declared): the coach copy over-grows the banner
The banner box is the 480 px center column (hud.tscn anchors 0.5 ±240) whose
right edge 880 is INSIDE the W17b disjointness budget (defense panel starts
x=904; test_mission_clicks pins panel buttons disjoint from VISIBLE HUD
rects). Pre-G8 the banner was outcome-only: empty+hidden in build, and
VICTORY/DEFEAT never reach 480 px — the budget was never exercised by a long
line. G8's first visible long line (the 72-char build-w0 copy) laid out at
552 px with grow_horizontal=BOTH -> x[364,916] -> the clicks gate went RED:
"GWMICE-FAIL panel button Sell overlaps HUD rect [(364,320),(552,80)]" —
a REAL overlap, the banner painting over the panel the copy itself points
at. FIX (hud-only, zero literals): setup sets
banner.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART — the box keeps its
shipped 480 px (right edge 880), the copy wraps to two lines, VICTORY/DEFEAT
rendering untouched (single words never wrap). The clicks gate going RED on
the first G8 tree is proof the pinned row has teeth for this card.

