## ENGINE FACT (this card, VERIFIED 4.7.2 --check-only)
- The `$../PhaseController` node-path form named in the brief is a GDScript
  PARSE ERROR: "Expected node path as string or identifier after "$"" — a
  `..` segment needs the QUOTED form `$"../PhaseController"`. The unquoted
  form made hud.gd fail to load, so every mission boot that mounts the HUD
  hung (a load-independent hang masquerading as the box-load timeouts; it is
  what cost the first gate runs). --check-only -s res://scripts/hud.gd rc=0
  after the fix. The wiring pin asserts the quoted form verbatim.

